│ patch_description        │ Restructure the algorithm into a multi-strategy pipeline: (1) generate candidate          │
│                          │ placements using several greedy ordering/selection heuristics (by r/s descending, by      │
│                          │ model size, best-fit by resulting KVPR), (2) evaluate each candidate's max KVPR, then (3) │
│                          │ apply an iterative refinement pass that greedily moves models from the hottest GPU to     │
│                          │ other GPUs when it lowers the overall max KVPR. This modular architecture explores a      │
│                          │ larger solution space and directly targets the min-max objective, improving placement     │
│                          │ quality while keeping the same interface.                                                 │
