│ patch_description        │ Add a perturbation-based iterated local search (ILS) on top of the existing local search: │
│                          │ (1) accept equal-score moves in the local search occasionally to enable escaping flat     │
│                          │ basins, (2) add pairwise swap moves between GPUs, and (3) apply a few random              │
│                          │ perturbations (random model relocation to a feasible GPU) followed by re-running local    │
│                          │ search, keeping the best solution found. Runtime remains tiny since problem sizes are     │
│                          │ small, and the best-found solution is always returned.                                    │
