│ patch_description        │ Add a 3-cycle rotation move to local_search(): after single-model moves and pairwise      │
│                          │ swaps fail, pick the three hottest GPUs and try cyclic rotations of the form (A from hot  │
│                          │ → g1, B from g1 → g2, C from g2 → hot). Each move is applied tentatively with feasibility │
│                          │ checks and accepted only if the new max KVPR strictly decreases. This extends the         │
│                          │ neighborhood beyond 1-opt moves and 2-swaps, helping escape local minima, and stacks with │
│                          │ the existing refine+ILS framework.                                                        │
